         <title>AstroTemps Redux Legacy 1.8.9 v1.0.2 (Windows)</title>
         <description>
            <p>Independent Windows PJSR/SpiderMonkey release for PixInsight 1.8.9. StarXTerminator -> StarNet2 fallback fix. ColorSaturation HSt enum type fixed. Offline checks passed; runtime in PixInsight 1.8.9 has not been verified. Requires compatible installed third-party processes.</p>
