         <title>AstroTemps Full Legacy 1.8.9 v1.0.0 (Windows)</title>
         <description>
            <p>Standalone configurable Full Legacy workflow; independent menu entry. StarXTerminator-to-StarNet2 fallback, ColorSaturation interpolation guard and stars-output validation. Runtime in PixInsight 1.8.9 is not yet verified; third-party modules are not bundled.</p>
         </description>
      </package>
